  "body": "If you're looking for a modern home that's been beautifully cared for and ready to move into, this one is well worth a look!\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2023, this immaculate three-bedroom, two-bathroom home is light, bright and welcoming from the moment you walk in. The modern kitchen sits at the heart of the home, flowing through to the open-plan dining and living area - a great space for everyday living.\r\n\r\nOutside, you'll find a private backyard that's perfect for making the most of the warmer months, whether it's a summer BBQ, a morning coffee in the sunshine or simply somewhere to relax.\r\n\r\nThere's also a single garage and an additional off-street car park.\r\n\r\nThe location is hard to beat too. With the ferry and marina close by, getting into the city is easy, and you also have beautiful beaches, parks, local restaurants and cafés right on your doorstep. The Gulf Harbour lifestyle is hard to beat!\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, downsizing or looking for a low maintenance lock and leave, this home is sure to appeal.\r\n\r\nCome along to an open home or call me for a viewing - you'll be glad you did!\r\n\r\nConjunctionals with other agents welcome.\r\n\r\nTo view/download property files please copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/XZSS",
